file Desktop\MR NIBBLES.TXT
	icon: res://win95/theme/icons/document_text_32.png
	modified: Friday, May 31, 1996 7:12:40 PM
	contents:
		MR. NIBBLES' DIARY
		by Lily, age 9

		Monday: Mr. Nibbles ran in his wheel 100 times. I counted.
		Tuesday: Mr. Nibbles ate a sunflower seed AND a raisin.
		Wednesday: Mr. Nibbles is missing!!!! Mom says he will turn up.
		Thursday: Still missing. Mom made a poster. The computer smells funny.
		Friday: Mom says we take the computer to the shop tomorrow.

mail
	from: Dad <p.anderson@aol.com>
	to: Lily <lily.a@hotmail.com>
	subject: Hi pumpkin
	sent: 1996-05-30 20:15
	read: true
	body:
		Hi pumpkin,

		I'll call you on Sunday. I'm sure Mr. Nibbles is hiding somewhere warm.

		Dad
